{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/997239-the-blood-preparation-topic","id":997239,"title":"The Blood Preparation Topic","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-11-02T10:53:36-07:00","id":997239,"title":"The Blood Preparation Topic","content":"In the Cwod, there was a book named &quot;<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">Dirty Secrets of the Black Hand&quot;. In the page 70, there is a secondary skill named &quot;Blood Preparation&quot;:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <br /> <b>BLOOD PREPARATION</b> </div> </div> </div></span></span><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <br /> <br /> You know the effects of various substances on the blood. You can use this knowledge to recognize foreign substances in any blood you taste, and you also know the art of feeding your victims certain substances to get the desired taste and effects. You are knowledgeable in chemicals, intoxicants, herbs, spices and food and how they affect mortal and inmortal blood. You can prepare a variety of flavours for blood feasts, and are capable of combining this art with Toxicology to make the blood of a living mortals dangerous to the Kindred.<br /> <br /> * Novice: You are a dabller; you can prepare simple meals.<br /> ** Practiced: Yot know several recipes and can perpare a variety of meals.<br /> *** Competent: You know many recipes, though you have trouble preparing truly exotic cusine.<br /> **** Expert: You are and excellent chef; you know all the great recipes aas well as a wide range of exotic recipes.<br /> ***** Master: You are a master chef; you know a great variety of recipes and you can create your own masterpieces.<br /> <br /> <br /> Possesed by: Some Toreador, Sabbat, baba Yaga's chefs, Black Hand Kindred and some cannibals.<br /> Specialities: Intoxicants, Spices, Easy-to-prepare meals, Kindred Poisons, Recognizing and Analysing Tastes.<br /> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">But, in the V20 version, </span></span>V20 The Black Hand: A Guide to the Tal'Mahe'Ra , actually i don't find any kind of reference to a similar skill or similar power.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">Was it ommited intentionally? I know it dosn't have por detailed rules about it is a skill i like very much. Would it be incluided in any further v20 book? </span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12604-axeldovidjenko","name":"AxelDovidjenko","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}